{"1":{"w":[{"c":"وَالْفَجْرِ","d":"wal-fajri","e":"By the dawn"}],"a":{"g":"By the dawn"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَيَالٍ","d":"walayālin","e":"And the nights"},{"c":"عَشْرٍ","d":"ʿashrin","e":"ten"}],"a":{"g":"And [by] ten nights"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"وَالشَّفْعِ","d":"wal-shafʿi","e":"And the even"},{"c":"وَالْوَتْرِ","d":"wal-watri","e":"and the odd"}],"a":{"g":"And [by] the even [number] and the odd"}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"وَاللَّيْلِ","d":"wa-al-layli","e":"And the night"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"when"},{"c":"يَسْرِ","d":"yasri","e":"it passes"}],"a":{"g":"And [by] the night when it passes,"}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"هَلْ","d":"hal","e":"Is"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"that"},{"c":"قَسَمٌ","d":"qasamun","e":"an oath"},{"c":"لِذِي","d":"lidhī","e":"for those"},{"c":"حِجْرٍ","d":"ḥij'rin","e":"who understand"}],"a":{"g":"Is there [not] in [all] that an oath [sufficient] for one of perception?"}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"أَلَمْ","d":"alam","e":"Do not"},{"c":"تَرَ","d":"tara","e":"you see"},{"c":"كَيْفَ","d":"kayfa","e":"how"},{"c":"فَعَلَ","d":"faʿala","e":"dealt"},{"c":"رَبُّكَ","d":"rabbuka","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"بِعَادٍ","d":"biʿādin","e":"with Aad"}],"a":{"g":"Have you not considered how your Lord dealt with 'Aad -"}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"إِرَمَ","d":"irama","e":"Iram"},{"c":"ذَاتِ","d":"dhāti","e":"possessors (of)"},{"c":"الْعِمَادِ","d":"l-ʿimādi","e":"lofty pillars"}],"a":{"g":"[With] Iram - who had lofty pillars,"}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"الَّتِي","d":"allatī","e":"Which"},{"c":"لَمْ","d":"lam","e":"not"},{"c":"يُخْلَقْ","d":"yukh'laq","e":"had been created"},{"c":"مِثْلُهَا","d":"mith'luhā","e":"like them"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْبِلَادِ","d":"l-bilādi","e":"the cities"}],"a":{"g":"The likes of whom had never been created in the land?"}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"وَثَمُودَ","d":"wathamūda","e":"And Thamud"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"who"},{"c":"جَابُوا","d":"jābū","e":"carved out"},{"c":"الصَّخْرَ","d":"l-ṣakhra","e":"the rocks"},{"c":"بِالْوَادِ","d":"bil-wādi","e":"in the valley"}],"a":{"g":"And [with] Thamud, who carved out the rocks in the valley?"}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"وَفِرْعَوْنَ","d":"wafir'ʿawna","e":"And Firaun"},{"c":"ذِي","d":"dhī","e":"owner of"},{"c":"الْأَوْتَادِ","d":"l-awtādi","e":"stakes"}],"a":{"g":"And [with] Pharaoh, owner of the stakes? -"}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"Who"},{"c":"طَغَوْا","d":"ṭaghaw","e":"transgressed"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْبِلَادِ","d":"l-bilādi","e":"the lands"}],"a":{"g":"[All of] whom oppressed within the lands"}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَكْثَرُوا","d":"fa-aktharū","e":"And made much"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"الْفَسَادَ","d":"l-fasāda","e":"corruption"}],"a":{"g":"And increased therein the corruption."}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"فَصَبَّ","d":"faṣabba","e":"So poured"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"on them"},{"c":"رَبُّكَ","d":"rabbuka","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"سَوْطَ","d":"sawṭa","e":"scourge"},{"c":"عَذَابٍ","d":"ʿadhābin","e":"(of) punishment"}],"a":{"g":"So your Lord poured upon them a scourge of punishment."}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"رَبَّكَ","d":"rabbaka","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"لَبِالْمِرْصَادِ","d":"labil-mir'ṣādi","e":"(is) surely Ever Watchful"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, your Lord is in observation."}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَمَّا","d":"fa-ammā","e":"And as for"},{"c":"الْإِنْسَانُ","d":"l-insānu","e":"man"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"when"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"does"},{"c":"ابْتَلَاهُ","d":"ib'talāhu","e":"try him"},{"c":"رَبُّهُ","d":"rabbuhu","e":"his Lord"},{"c":"فَأَكْرَمَهُ","d":"fa-akramahu","e":"and is generous to him"},{"c":"وَنَعَّمَهُ","d":"wanaʿʿamahu","e":"and favors him"},{"c":"فَيَقُولُ","d":"fayaqūlu","e":"he says"},{"c":"رَبِّي","d":"rabbī","e":"My Lord"},{"c":"أَكْرَمَنِ","d":"akramani","e":"has honored me"}],"a":{"g":"And as for man, when his Lord tries him and [thus] is generous to him and favors him, he says, \"My Lord has honored me.\""}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَمَّا","d":"wa-ammā","e":"But"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"when"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"does"},{"c":"ابْتَلَاهُ","d":"ib'talāhu","e":"He try him"},{"c":"فَقَدَرَ","d":"faqadara","e":"and restricts"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِ","d":"ʿalayhi","e":"for him"},{"c":"رِزْقَهُ","d":"riz'qahu","e":"his provision"},{"c":"فَيَقُولُ","d":"fayaqūlu","e":"then he says"},{"c":"رَبِّي","d":"rabbī","e":"My Lord"},{"c":"أَهَانَنِ","d":"ahānani","e":"(has) humiliated me"}],"a":{"g":"But when He tries him and restricts his provision, he says, \"My Lord has humiliated me.\""}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"كَلَّا","d":"kallā","e":"Nay!"},{"c":"بَلْ","d":"bal","e":"But"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"تُكْرِمُونَ","d":"tuk'rimūna","e":"you honor"},{"c":"الْيَتِيمَ","d":"l-yatīma","e":"the orphan"}],"a":{"g":"No! But you do not honor the orphan"}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"And not"},{"c":"تَحَاضُّونَ","d":"taḥāḍḍūna","e":"you feel the urge"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"to"},{"c":"طَعَامِ","d":"ṭaʿāmi","e":"feed"},{"c":"الْمِسْكِينِ","d":"l-mis'kīni","e":"the poor"}],"a":{"g":"And you do not encourage one another to feed the poor."}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"وَتَأْكُلُونَ","d":"watakulūna","e":"And you consume"},{"c":"التُّرَاثَ","d":"l-turātha","e":"the inheritance"},{"c":"أَكْلًا","d":"aklan","e":"devouring"},{"c":"لَمًّا","d":"lamman","e":"altogether"}],"a":{"g":"And you consume inheritance, devouring [it] altogether,"}},"20":{"w":[{"c":"وَتُحِبُّونَ","d":"watuḥibbūna","e":"And you love"},{"c":"الْمَالَ","d":"l-māla","e":"wealth"},{"c":"حُبًّا","d":"ḥubban","e":"(with) love"},{"c":"جَمًّا","d":"jamman","e":"exceeding"}],"a":{"g":"And you love wealth with immense love."}},"21":{"w":[{"c":"كَلَّا","d":"kallā","e":"Nay"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"When"},{"c":"دُكَّتِ","d":"dukkati","e":"is leveled"},{"c":"الْأَرْضُ","d":"l-arḍu","e":"the earth"},{"c":"دَكًّا","d":"dakkan","e":"pounded"},{"c":"دَكًّا","d":"dakkan","e":"(and) crushed"}],"a":{"g":"No! When the earth has been leveled - pounded and crushed -"}},"22":{"w":[{"c":"وَجَاءَ","d":"wajāa","e":"And comes"},{"c":"رَبُّكَ","d":"rabbuka","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"وَالْمَلَكُ","d":"wal-malaku","e":"and the Angels"},{"c":"صَفًّا","d":"ṣaffan","e":"rank"},{"c":"صَفًّا","d":"ṣaffan","e":"(upon) rank"}],"a":{"g":"And your Lord has come and the angels, rank upon rank,"}},"23":{"w":[{"c":"وَجِاىءَ","d":"wajīa","e":"And is brought"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"بِجَهَنَّمَ","d":"bijahannama","e":"Hell"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"That Day"},{"c":"يَتَذَكَّرُ","d":"yatadhakkaru","e":"will remember"},{"c":"الْإِنْسَانُ","d":"l-insānu","e":"man"},{"c":"وَأَنَّى","d":"wa-annā","e":"but how"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"(will be) for him"},{"c":"الذِّكْرَى","d":"l-dhik'rā","e":"the remembrance"}],"a":{"g":"And brought [within view], that Day, is Hell - that Day, man will remember, but what good to him will be the remembrance?"}},"24":{"w":[{"c":"يَقُولُ","d":"yaqūlu","e":"He will say"},{"c":"يَالَيْتَنِي","d":"yālaytanī","e":"O! I wish"},{"c":"قَدَّمْتُ","d":"qaddamtu","e":"I had sent forth"},{"c":"لِحَيَاتِي","d":"liḥayātī","e":"for my life"}],"a":{"g":"He will say, \"Oh, I wish I had sent ahead [some good] for my life.\""}},"25":{"w":[{"c":"فَيَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"fayawma-idhin","e":"So that Day"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"يُعَذِّبُ","d":"yuʿadhibu","e":"will punish"},{"c":"عَذَابَهُ","d":"ʿadhābahu","e":"(as) His punishment"},{"c":"أَحَدٌ","d":"aḥadun","e":"anyone"}],"a":{"g":"So on that Day, none will punish [as severely] as His punishment,"}},"26":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"And not"},{"c":"يُوثِقُ","d":"yūthiqu","e":"will bind"},{"c":"وَثَاقَهُ","d":"wathāqahu","e":"(as) His binding"},{"c":"أَحَدٌ","d":"aḥadun","e":"anyone"}],"a":{"g":"And none will bind [as severely] as His binding [of the evildoers]."}},"27":{"w":[{"c":"يَاأَيَّتُهَا","d":"yāayyatuhā","e":"O"},{"c":"النَّفْسُ","d":"l-nafsu","e":"soul"},{"c":"الْمُطْمَئِنَّةُ","d":"l-muṭ'ma-inatu","e":"who is satisfied"}],"a":{"g":"[To the righteous it will be said], \"O reassured soul,"}},"28":{"w":[{"c":"ارْجِعِي","d":"ir'jiʿī","e":"Return"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"رَبِّكِ","d":"rabbiki","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"رَاضِيَةً","d":"rāḍiyatan","e":"well pleased"},{"c":"مَرْضِيَّةً","d":"marḍiyyatan","e":"and pleasing"}],"a":{"g":"Return to your Lord, well-pleased and pleasing [to Him],"}},"29":{"w":[{"c":"فَادْخُلِي","d":"fa-ud'khulī","e":"So enter"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"among"},{"c":"عِبَادِي","d":"ʿibādī","e":"My slaves"}],"a":{"g":"And enter among My [righteous] servants"}},"30":{"w":[{"c":"وَادْخُلِي","d":"wa-ud'khulī","e":"And enter"},{"c":"جَنَّتِي","d":"jannatī","e":"My Paradise"}],"a":{"g":"And enter My Paradise.\""}}}